      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A short secondary anneal can stabilize the refined microstructure without coarsening the B2 phase.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A controlled atmosphere is required to prevent oxidation during processing.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing parameters must be optimized for each eutectic HEA composition to obtain selective FCC recrystallization while retaining B2 integrity.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9365806::web::011::psr_mechanisms"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will produce fully recrystallized fine FCC grains embedded in a continuous skeletal B2 network.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9365806::web::011::psr_mechanisms"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Selective FCC recrystallization enhances ductility and strain-hardening capacity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9365806::web::011::psr_mechanisms"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preserving the B2 network maintains or improves strength through load carrying.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9365806::web::011::psr_mechanisms"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combination of recrystallized FCC and preserved B2 overcomes the conventional strength–ductility trade-off.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
